# The bridge is published to GitHub Packages, private (it inherits the
# visibility of leviyehonatan/rsd-next-bridge). GH_PACKAGES_TOKEN must be a
# personal access token with read:packages from an account with read access
# to that repo — see the README's Install section.
@leviyehonatan:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GH_PACKAGES_TOKEN}
